<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed higher in moderate trading.</p>
<p>The Amex index closed at 600.47, up 2.45.</p>
<p>Winners beat losers 252 to 249.</p>
<p>The average price per share was up $0.06.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 17,157,045 compared with 20,033,195 on Thursday.</p>
<p>	  (Prices official as of 1645 EST/2145 GMT)</p>
</text>
